    "name": "ExpresoFast - Lab 6 (JWT + RBAC)",
    "description": "Coleccion de pruebas de la API REST de ExpresoFast (IF0009 - Laboratorio 6, carne C4H845).\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n1. Ejecute '01 Login ADMIN' (guarda automaticamente {{token}} y {{token_admin}}).\n2. Pruebe los endpoints de la carpeta 'Envios'.\n3. Cambie de rol ejecutando '02 Login OPERADOR' o '03 Login CONDUCTOR' y repita las llamadas para observar los 403 de la matriz RBAC.\n\nUsuarios de prueba: admin/admin123, operador1/oper123, conductor1/cond123.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_admin", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_operador", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_conductor", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "envioId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "vehiculoId", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
